{"unit_id":"ningbonb__dsh-client-ui-brand#feature-sidebar","repo":"ningbonb/dsh-client-ui-brand","commit":"22e879cb8b0d1a116ef6d0aecadccbd8fd7db26f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-client-ui-brand 的功能「侧边栏品牌」：把配置的产品名称和图标放入 DSH Web 侧边栏品牌插槽。插件从启动时注入的品牌配置生成名称与图标组件，并保留宿主插槽提供的尺寸。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:24-35","src/client/Brand.tsx:48-60"]}
{"unit_id":"ningbonb__dsh-client-ui-brand#feature-title","repo":"ningbonb/dsh-client-ui-brand","commit":"22e879cb8b0d1a116ef6d0aecadccbd8fd7db26f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-client-ui-brand 的功能「浏览器标题」：将页面标题中的产品后缀替换为配置名称，并监听标题 DOM 变化以维持该后缀。未含分隔符的标题会改为产品名称。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/title.ts:1-22"]}
{"unit_id":"ningbonb__dsh-client-ui-brand#feature-icons","repo":"ningbonb/dsh-client-ui-brand","commit":"22e879cb8b0d1a116ef6d0aecadccbd8fd7db26f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-client-ui-brand 的功能「浏览器与 PWA 图标」：配置标志后生成方形 SVG 图标并提供 PWA manifest，替换 Web Shell 的 favicon 和 manifest 链接；未配置标志时保留默认链接。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:116-134","src/index.ts:286-312"]}
{"unit_id":"ningbonb__dsh-client-ui-brand#feature-local","repo":"ningbonb/dsh-client-ui-brand","commit":"22e879cb8b0d1a116ef6d0aecadccbd8fd7db26f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-client-ui-brand 的功能「本地图标」：读取配置的本地图片并通过固定品牌图标路由提供；路径须为绝对路径，文件须为受支持扩展名的普通文件。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:175-188","src/index.ts:330-335"]}
